#heading(level: 1, "Native M31 local diagnostic - 2026-11-27")
#text("The native code returned and locally replayed all 18 planted decomposition controls. None of the 18 bounded IC searches recovered an ordinary target. Two searches collected one row each (rank 1); the remaining IC searches collected none. Native Pollard rho recovered both ordinary targets and replayed their scalars. These are unsigned producer observations, not independently verified results. [pcc:unverified]")
#parbreak()
#text("The requested coordinate field is **Fp, p=2147483647=2^31-1**. The summand counts are 2, 3, 4. Earlier binary-field/31-summand artifacts are separate and provide no evidence for this run. The native reference curve is y^2=x^3+2x+14, scalar order N=2147505293, G=(1,814455902); p and N differ. [pcc:unverified]")
#parbreak()
#heading(level: 2, "Execution and evidence")
#text("Source: `94c0b5d8fac0207d21f2e972d80909d29a2c1dd9`; CLI SHA256 `dca496dbd496bdf055a50180b55260f0b0217704bb57f77aa7e59fbc8c4b9622`. Native fixture SHA256 `86dc7b80b3fa823a0c1ed3fddd0a3cdeac6582bbe750aa4809c0413d23ee2614`. Frozen protocol commit: `9846fad`; runner commit: `94c0b5d`. The protocol and seed file were committed before outcomes. The richer experiment.protocol/v1 JSON preregistration was not filed; this is a descriptive diagnostic, with no qualified A/B or speedup claim. [pcc:unverified]")
#parbreak()
#text("Host: AMD EPYC 9V74, shared container, five available logical CPUs; no isolation tier earned. Debug native CLI, release native fixture helper, native C rho reference. Do not compare fixture timing with solver timing. User authorized local CPU execution and local storage. Raw artifacts have not been uploaded to S3. [pcc:unverified]")
#parbreak()
#text("Controls: 19 existing native release tests passed (3 multi_summands, 11 pipeline, 5 random_control). The helper checks [N]G=O and valid points. Solver processes receive public coordinates only; evaluator scalars stay in a separate file. The frozen factor-base child stream is reserved but unused because bases are deterministic. [pcc:unverified]")
#parbreak()
#text("The torus and direct-torus arms use identical 71-column bases; the interval arm uses 75 columns from x=0..127. Actual paired column hashes, public input hashes and sampler seeds match. Torus uses auto/AVX2; direct arms use scalar. This is the declared arm comparison, not an isolated encoding or SIMD comparison. [pcc:unverified]")
#parbreak()
#text("Flow: planned 56, attempted 56, native reports 56, excluded 0. PDP: 18 found rows, all locally replayed, including 9 repeated mathematical outputs. Yield: 10 complete 512-query prefixes, 8 time-censored prefixes. Solve: 18 incomplete IC searches. Rho: 2 recovered references (the enclosing one-query IC status remains incomplete). No watchdog kill or missing native report occurred. [pcc:unverified]")
#parbreak()
#text("The CLI returns exit 1 for relation_found/incomplete in this revision. Raw exit codes are preserved; those reports are classified by native status rather than treated as process crashes. TimeBudget is checked between batches, so m4 torus exceeds its 1.5/2 s soft budget; the independent 20 s watchdog remained in force. [pcc:unverified]")
