#text("Torus depth is membership-circuit depth, not addition-network topology. The present experiment does not discharge all five original research leads. The first next implementation comparison is a fixed-m shared-input serial/balanced/S4 system against guarded explicit addition, with a prospective protocol and equal completed prefixes. Current observed bottleneck: the existing structured m3/m4 search completes substantially shorter prefixes within its cap; test smaller flushed batches or per-query circuit work before another bounded run. Neither optimization has been measured here. [pcc:unverified]")
